## WebhostingApi

### Place a new webhosting order, create the invoice, and queue provisioning
## Place a new webhosting order, create the invoice, and queue provisioning
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/websites/order
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

{
 "hostname": "<string>",
 "packageId": "<number>",
 "rootpass": "<string>",
 "period": "<number>",
 "coupon": "<string>",
 "serviceOfferId": "<number>",
 "script": "<number>",
 "comment": "<string>",
 "registerDomain": "<string>"
}


